              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima abantu b'omu nsi egyo baatwara Yehoahazi mwene Yosia, baamwemeka omu mwanya gwa ishe omuri Yerusaalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoahazi akaba aine emyaka makumi abiri n'eshatu, obu yaatandika kutegyeka; yaategyekyera Yerusaalemu ameezi ashatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima y'ago meezi ashatu omugabe wa Misri yaamwiha aha ngoma omuri Yerusaalemu, yaacwera ab'omuri egyo nsi etalanta z'efeeza igana n'etalanta emwe y'ezaabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima omugabe wa Misri ogwo Neeko yaayemeka Eliakimu mukuru we kuba omugabe wa Yuda na Yerusaalemu, yaahindura eiziina rye, yaamweta Yehoyakimu; kandi yaakwata Yehoahazi omurumuna, yaamutwara Misri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
