          "text": " Aha kutandika kw'omwaka Nebukadeneeza yaatuma, baamutwara Babulooni n'ebintu by'obuguzi bwingi eby'enju ya MUKAMA, yaayemeka mukuru we Zedekia kuba omugabe wa Yuda na Yerusaalemu.",
