        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi yaagomera omugabe Nebukadeneeza owaamurahiize ahari Ruhanga; yaagaruka yaagangaaza ebitsya, yaagumya omutima gwe, yaayanga kuhindukira MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
