        {
          "text": " N'ahabw'ekyo MUKAMA yaabateeza omugabe w'Abakaludaaya, yaitira abatsigazi baabo omu nju y'Obutaaho bwabo oburikwera na rurara, tiyaagirira muntu weena saasi, omutsigazi nari empangare, omugurusi nari owaahikire omu ngingo zaabukuru; yaabahayo boona omu mikono y'ogwo mugabe. ",
          "type": "text",
