            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abaahonokire ahari rurara Nebukadeneeza yaabatwara Babulooni, baaba abahuuku be n'aba'abatabani, okuhitsya aha kutandika kw'obugabe bwa Perisi, ",
