          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oku nikwo Kuuro omugabe wa Perisi arikugamba naagira ati: MUKAMA, Ruhanga w'eiguru, ampaire obugabe bwona obw'omu nsi, kandi anyehanangiriize kumwombekyera enju omuri Yerusaalemu ey'omuri Yuda. Mbwenu omuntu weena omuriimwe ow'omu bantu be, MUKAMA Ruhanga we agume nawe; kandi ainamukye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
